@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

package "Frontend application" {
  [Composition root] as Root
  [Operations panel shell] as Shell
  [Mission operations view] as Planning
  [Result validation view] as Validation
  [Heatmap operations view] as Analysis
  [Location search view] as Search
  [Navigation workflow] as Navigation
  [Mission workflow] as Mission
  [Heatmap workflow] as Heatmap
  [Map rendering boundary] as Rendering
  [Mission API adapter] as MissionApi
  [Result API adapter] as ResultApi
  [Projection API adapter] as ProjectionApi
  [Local appearance preferences] as Preferences
}

cloud "Backend /api/v1" as Backend

Root --> Shell
Root --> Navigation
Root --> Mission
Root --> Heatmap
Shell --> Planning
Shell --> Validation
Shell --> Analysis
Navigation --> Search
Navigation --> Rendering
Mission --> Rendering
Mission --> MissionApi
Validation --> ResultApi
Heatmap --> ProjectionApi
Heatmap --> Preferences
Rendering --> Preferences

MissionApi --> Backend
ResultApi --> Backend
ProjectionApi --> Backend

note right of Rendering
  Owns map layers, numeric tile source,
  WebGL palette updates, hover values,
  version switching, and CPU fallback.
  Application tests do not depend on
  OpenLayers internals.
end note

note bottom of Backend
  The browser consumes typed contracts.
  It never communicates directly with a drone.
end note
@enduml
